Error [E0003]: this line computes a value but doesn't do anything with it
  --> tests/ui/two_parse_errors.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     val 1 = 2;
    |     ^^^
 Why: a statement must have an effect: a call, a binding, an assignment, or `return`
 Fix: use the value, e.g. `x :: ...` or `print(...)`

